  "new_commit_message": "Update the Agent Platform skills.\n\n- Update Agent Platform deploy, prompt management, and endpoint management skills for current models, SDKs, and gcloud flags.\n- Update RAG Engine management skill examples from Gemini 2.5 models to `gemini-3.8-flash`.\n- Add standardized usage attribution to Agent Platform skills.  - Add `references/attribution.md` to all 9 Model Garden Agent Platform skills. - Add concise `## Attribution` directives in `SKILL.md` with core attribution tokens and generated-code guardrails.\n- Default validation_split to None in convert_to_jsonl so programmatic prompt_only=True calls do not fail, and include adapter size 2 in tune_open_model.py CLI choices.\n- Add Qwen3.8-27B to the open-model tuning catalog and cost calculator.\n- Add distillation tuning to the agent-platform-tuning skill: supported teacher and student models, prompt-only training datasets (prepare_dataset.py --prompt_only), and --method/--teacher_model flags in tune_open_model.py.\n- Improve skill instructions for model-registry and agent-cli skills.\n- Improve skill instructions for tuning, tuning-management, and eval-flywheel skills.\n- Improve interactive confirmation and post-deletion verification guidance in prompt management skill.\n- Improve deployment region confirmation and hardware validation guidance in agent-platform-deploy skill.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1023012351",
